00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
The Battle of Olympus.

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.540
This is an ancient story.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.500
A time when men and gods live together.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:30.200
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

