00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:54.640
You have to rescue a princess.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:59.760
I guess that's up for debate, you know, like, where she stands on, like, Zelda's hierarchy of princesses.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.360
